{"event_type":"review","id":"69091c43bc6bf5f15771c06a28d76767e439a19794f97d7b580b3a2f2e5f96d1","occurred_at":"2026-11-18T03:35:05Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0a2d329268f7290b99f18dd6b16d8b39a7a3caf8b272006bfe86f201cf69e9c6","sha256":"0a2d329268f7290b99f18dd6b16d8b39a7a3caf8b272006bfe86f201cf69e9c6"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ef547c5ccf90720234d8f953260a22a38d795ddd8f8fb12c8c4530834f3422c2","sha256":"ef547c5ccf90720234d8f953260a22a38d795ddd8f8fb12c8c4530834f3422c2"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9cfd0ac80cfcf76b2e2bf69a1ca795174cf8af6faf5eae5f183ea50292739fab","sha256":"9cfd0ac80cfcf76b2e2bf69a1ca795174cf8af6faf5eae5f183ea50292739fab"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/a07bd222180be3849faff50da5d3b9812d4cb77147a546670c5e03f82741bd20","sha256":"a07bd222180be3849faff50da5d3b9812d4cb77147a546670c5e03f82741bd20"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c97fd16aedf36aad532f4e5d0e0fbf6a7a1b2907f8deed0a96802a5f056d23c7","sha256":"c97fd16aedf36aad532f4e5d0e0fbf6a7a1b2907f8deed0a96802a5f056d23c7"}],"attempt_id":"dcfe2693ca4ee54cde713e5946555e890bfbf65a3b1012229b71e9e3de9c0e57:0:1","base":"b14877d3e0daf381fb2f516089a843e437be4dbd","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"2f23873a4921034eb234f7cf5ecdb929264a44e2","body":"**Skip the normalized grep provenance test when `rg` is absent.**\n\nThe test injects `resolveRg` as successful, so the driver offers `grep`. The grep tool then runs `runArgvCommand('rg', ...)` from `PATH` with no fallback. On a host without `rg`, the spawn fails, grep returns a denial, and no `secret.ts` content reaches `beforeRequest`. The assertions at `test/driver/ai-sdk.scan-provenance.test.ts:99-101` then fail. The raw-grep test at line 203 already skips in this case, so this test should use a matching prerequisite.\n\nGate on installation, not usability. An `rg` older than `RG_MINIMUM_VERSION` still runs, and this test exists to cover that case. Gating on `rgUsable` would skip it on old-`rg` hosts.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-const rgUsable = (await probeRgVersion()).ok === true;\n+const rgProbe = await probeRgVersion();\n+const rgUsable = rgProbe.ok === true;\n+// rg is installed when the probe succeeds or reports a version below the minimum.\n+const rgInstalled = rgUsable || (rgProbe.ok === false && rgProbe.reason === 'old');\n```\n\n```diff\n-  test('grep upload scanning uses normalized executor provenance for matched files', async () => {\n+  test.skipIf(!rgInstalled)('grep upload scanning uses normalized executor provenance for matched files', async () => {\n```\n\n</details>","id":"7417a83fda061113aafd8aebb5afaba7e30a53b4b24dccab5f66d0a2814717a7","intervals":[[86,86]],"path":"test/driver/ai-sdk.scan-provenance.test.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Skip the normalized grep provenance test when `rg` is absent."}],"head":"0ce121bfc9f475458614575901ba39790ef0a999","head_tree":"12e1095fbecea104e28eb07c86b1760f1f72bd77","input_scope":[{"blob":"9e37724c801484909a88bde48a076dd912147dfc","intervals":[[1,514]],"path":"test/driver/ai-sdk.dispatch.test.ts"},{"blob":"b1ea261dc654ccad20699cb4fe95b3d9c6f9fc32","intervals":[[1,407]],"path":"test/driver/ai-sdk.prompt-shaping.test.ts"},{"blob":"0f49161e9f8ec7646455b37c1ca7318ac317dfd1","intervals":[[1,300]],"path":"test/driver/ai-sdk.rg-seam.test.ts"},{"blob":"2f23873a4921034eb234f7cf5ecdb929264a44e2","intervals":[[1,247]],"path":"test/driver/ai-sdk.scan-provenance.test.ts"},{"blob":"c536e0b63e3826b022a96e610a0482dad7436c31","intervals":[[1,578]],"path":"test/driver/ai-sdk.structured-output.test.ts"},{"blob":"576754aa0cbfb6ee105c251ec670a946bd38da9b","intervals":[[1,197]],"pa